{'id':'JOINT-HEAD','state':'SCORE_PRESERVING_ARGMAX_OR_STRONGER_ID_ONLY_ARE_DIFFERENT_DOMAINS','analysis':'A public BF16 argmax replacement can preserve score banks and other observers. A stronger ID-only path needs raw/processed/logprob/entropy/confidence/processor/RNG demands reconciled; do not make that stronger guard a prerequisite for the narrower public replacement.','guards':'Tie,NaN/Inf,index width,INT32-to-INT64 interface and all pre-return checks retained. No post-return random/recovery savings credited to a valid all-greedy branch.'},
